    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command historical general, recruit soldiers, fight every wave of enemies to save the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customizing your defensive strategy with different skills and upgrades.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle within 30 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive waves lasting 20 to 100 seconds each and kill off as many enemies as possible</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771660/extras/b7f96dab710b636190d8499b1738391f.poster.avif?t=1755337626\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771660/extras/b7f96dab710b636190d8499b1738391f.webm?t=1755337626\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771660/extras/b7f96dab710b636190d8499b1738391f.mp4?t=1755337626\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain skills by passing levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get buildings to recruit soldiers to assist</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Obtain equipment to strengthen your hero</p></li></ul>",
